t:
In these skirmishes, two teams battle at a randomly selected field:

- Witch's Hollow;

- Deserted Farm;

- Training Camp;

If one of the participants leaves the skirmish during battle, the next queuing player will take their place.

The combat rules are different for each battleground.

As a reward, all Skirmish participants will receive Signs of Victory which can be transformed into Battleground Emblems. Emblems can be used to purchase various goods from vendors in the capitals.
